# Scene rooms

- Home Poké Center = backdrop FR/LG PNG — see `poke-center-room.mdc` and `docs/POKE_CENTER.md`.
- New interiors = tileset RSE (`tiled` mode), variable grid, explicit collisions.
- Do not assume 15×10 grid except home demo.
- Use `createSceneFromTemplate()` for new admin scenes; bump `DEMO_ASSET_PACK` only for home changes.
- Project IDs use `center` (American English); Essentials source paths keep `Centre` spelling.
- Gyms may have interior wall sections — paint walls + sync collisions, not a single enclosed box.
